{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0056_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_06_title", "source_sha256": "e72f7dcfe8da84e89f1de22c7126060abe0f3bca42f221423e934fe9dc6b1c35", "ja": "星空の下で輝いて！", "zh": "在星空下闪耀！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0056_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_06_synopsis", "source_sha256": "47b6af2c432624fa0e31ec580d2d7e62be2c95447d520a62549b88f92a176ff4", "ja": "ついに頂上に到着。星梨花は夜空いっぱいの\n流星群に感動する。ちょっぴりドキドキした\nけれど、登ってきてよかった。みんなで心を\n一つにして、流星群に負けないくらいの星を\nみんなで降らそうと、本番公演に挑む。", "zh": "终于抵达了山顶。\n星梨花为遍布夜空的流星雨感动不已。\n虽然过程有些紧张，但有爬上来真是太好了。\n众人团结一心，打算一同降下\n不输流星雨的星星，来挑战正式公演。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0056_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_06_1000_022ser", "source_sha256": "6b71433cb9434ada74b02ee9de151e2eb62d1f7a5f5eb710730849c5d30a4bcb", "ja": "はぁ……っ、はぁ……っ。\nもうちょっと……。", "zh": "呼……呼……\n还差一点……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0056_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_06_1001_014mir", "source_sha256": "a26564197de5b39520a75d0b6d82adeaeb2baca2b2e161db58d71c098f8fff31", "ja": "あ、見えた！　あそこが頂上みたい。\nやったね星梨花♪　ほら、ゆっくりで大丈夫だよ。", "zh": "啊，看见了！那里好像就是山顶。\n太好了，星梨花♪不要紧，你可以慢慢来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0056_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_06_1002_022ser", "source_sha256": "4c126bd7f436d1d60ab4a23f63bd14488f3b41229d76a6e4ee52dd50a8034384", "ja": "えへへ……、坂道を登るコツが、\n少しわかってきた気がします。", "zh": "嘿嘿……\n我觉得自己有点抓到爬坡的诀窍了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0056_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_06_1003_041fuk", "source_sha256": "14f24c6d63d4fec378b733d221055e18758562a8ec1595d707b1989e47848e51", "ja": "星梨花ちゃん、足はすっかり大丈夫みたいね。\nよかった♪", "zh": "星梨花的脚，感觉已经完全没问题了呢。\n太好了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0056_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_06_1004_017kth", "source_sha256": "d9c07e0313cec5e8c7ddd72cc22d0cae010d5a59686986751c6d38c7a4d8af9b", "ja": "風花さんの処置のおかげですね。それに、未来が\nちゃんと先導して……ふふっ、なんだか頼もしいです。", "zh": "多亏有风花姊处理伤口，\n还有未来在前面认真带路……呵呵，感觉很可靠呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0056_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_06_1005_028ari", "source_sha256": "c987e2d5911c7c360ead93b1800eb9e891a69eaaaf581356cbe3faedca6cf3d9", "ja": "さりげなく星梨花ちゃんを気遣いながら歩く、未来\nちゃんの姿……。ありさ、今にも鼻血が出そうです！", "zh": "在星梨花前面带路，未来如此不着痕迹的体贴……\n让亚利沙的鼻血都快要流出来了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0056_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_06_1006_p", "source_sha256": "699c729af23ce151d294c88d493c3844586eabc8151aa6b9936effc0bfeb0d2e", "ja": "ほらほら、最後まで気を抜くなよ。\n頂上まであと少し……おっ！", "zh": "好了好了，到最后都别松懈喔。\n离山顶还差一点……哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0056_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_06_1007_014mir", "source_sha256": "f7e4e2828f505c3508b820872fc948196140bdf5248cfb5f907fb7cacdfc1885", "ja": "せーのっ！", "zh": "预备──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0056_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_06_1008_014mir", "source_sha256": "1ac3a0972e7cacff1b483f0db0a4dd3a824fc8dc26adab897245ea912cb0f71b", "ja": "とーちゃーーく！", "zh": "到──了──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0056_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_06_1009_022ser", "source_sha256": "1ac3a0972e7cacff1b483f0db0a4dd3a824fc8dc26adab897245ea912cb0f71b", "ja": "とーちゃーーく！", "zh": "到──了──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0056_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_06_1010_014mir", "source_sha256": "da155c6011cd538e59625b2f79af7f0f2ef759f5450f45add2adacbfca3939f5", "ja": "わああ……！　すごい、すごいよ星梨花！\nまわりが全部ぜーんぶ、星空～！", "zh": "哇啊啊……！好漂亮、好漂亮耶，星梨花！\n四周全──部都是星空～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0056_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_06_1012_028ari", "source_sha256": "72372c1c4da73d522adf885feccc93c7b76d05e355aeb8399500a04724646a0e", "ja": "はぁぁぁぁ、やっぱりすごいです！\nありさ史上、最高クラスのロケーションですよぉ！", "zh": "啊啊啊啊，果然很不得了！\n这是亚利沙史上最高等级的地点了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0056_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_06_1013_017kth", "source_sha256": "886b0dd868afaafcf5b3ec09cd0e817ae80320875325999c35af9e5d477fd659", "ja": "これが……これが本物の星空なんですね！", "zh": "这就是……这就是真正的星空对吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0056_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_06_1014_041fuk", "source_sha256": "eef4dc3c764e7ccbe9cb913f5976fa9431439441cd1f9959e123c895810e0d47", "ja": "まるで、童話の世界みたい……♪", "zh": "简直像童话世界一样……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0056_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_06_1015_014mir", "source_sha256": "fd862f42046300c8530a0354e5716c7cd7f4ca9fee984fe87966121307cc2892", "ja": "あっ、流れ星！　ほら、みんな見えた！？\nあそこあそこ！", "zh": "啊，是流星！大家有看到吗！？\n那里那里！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0056_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_06_1016_028ari", "source_sha256": "8561c0822d46499132993e44fb1655939ecbb136dbb901b488f391d383b09d92", "ja": "ふわあああ！　こうしちゃいられませんっ！\n急いでカメラ、組み立てますっ！", "zh": "呼啊啊啊！！现在不是光看的时候了！\n得赶快来架起相机！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0056_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_06_1017_014mir", "source_sha256": "d8457201c80f24b24a8d31a924252e8e74cd55c6c3540a4fea0db1d024d938ad", "ja": "あっ、あっちにも！\nあっ、こっちにも！　ね、見えたよね、星梨花！", "zh": "啊，那里也有！\n啊，这里也有！欸，你有看见吧，星梨花！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0056_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_06_1019_022ser", "source_sha256": "41093b09b826ed6bcf31e21b09ce7a6b19471d893a87bb2fbd12fbd45d72fe4a", "ja": "……ぐすっ。", "zh": "……呜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0056_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_06_1020_014mir", "source_sha256": "70d75f777e27a8d02f7b0930ccd2e5c68883e2212cae2448bd70c796cf4e2d7e", "ja": "え……？", "zh": "咦……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0056_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_06_1021_p", "source_sha256": "c5297c8fcd3bcc5303624b49702387a9e18cccae7709126afbe68127b58df1d9", "ja": "星梨花？\nもしかして、傷が痛むのか？", "zh": "星梨花？\n难道你的脚在痛吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0056_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_06_1022_022ser", "source_sha256": "3f9aa58142422fce3cf67c1ebac06438911157cf0476bf36970934d76e8fd5e6", "ja": "あ、すみません！\nそうじゃなくて……。", "zh": "啊，不好意思！\n不是这样的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0056_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_06_1023_022ser", "source_sha256": "b22c83ca0b8b9216cdf6a5469e86d9cce2fa85198a3ff1d6083fa31267860380", "ja": "流星群が……。星空が、とってもきれいで。\nわたし……なんだか、うれしくて……！", "zh": "流星雨……星空实在太漂亮了。\n我觉得……好高兴……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0056_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_06_1024_014mir", "source_sha256": "c449100d08ed7601e328c777406a598446a4390ba81540a4cd89863e95ad13eb", "ja": "星梨花……。\nえへへ、そうだね。よかったね、星梨花！", "zh": "星梨花……\n嘿嘿，对啊。太好了呢，星梨花！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0056_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_06_1025_022ser", "source_sha256": "5156b4a09d4eb07ab5cee36baa7dd1a1b4077785e64af7f295e73a66eebd4ecd", "ja": "はい……未来さんのおかげです！\nわたしがここまで来られたのは、未来さんと……", "zh": "嗯……这要谢谢未来姊姊！\n我能顺利来到这里，都是多亏了未来姊姊跟……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0056_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_06_1026_022ser", "source_sha256": "dfa5622c9c91231372dc5398694f311cb8d8cddef4b9498aff59026b0606a2f9", "ja": "風花さんと、琴葉さんと、亜利沙さんと……\n{$P$}さんのおかげです。", "zh": "风花姊姊、琴叶姊姊、亚利沙姊姊还有……\n{$P$}先生。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0056_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_06_1027_022ser", "source_sha256": "bb6803f119d557d4826864d3b618b5c1ec5660f2f34ffa8db9baa617d612bf5e", "ja": "みなさんのおかげで、わたし……。\n夢みたいな星空が見られました。", "zh": "多亏有大家帮忙，我……\n才能看见这么梦幻的星空。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0056_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_06_1028_022ser", "source_sha256": "705ed5239a533859cb30fbf78c30e6b2b64f68689b2fd30684dc751e004b7ce9", "ja": "ほんとうに、ほんとうに……\nありがとうございました！", "zh": "真的、真的……\n非常谢谢大家！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0056_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_06_1029_p", "source_sha256": "8050d42444fd23b6ecee31474bb19d38720c5ae71bec6d159f28a3abeca7b272", "ja": "（確かに、今回は星梨花のために、\nみんながんばってくれた。でも……）", "zh": "（这次为了星梨花，\n大家确实都很努力，不过……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0056_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_06_1030_014mir", "source_sha256": "1f26ecdbf2e975a38a2cc613e9cdf9d4e4dfb9e72cc7597e6897db89d51db53e", "ja": "えへへ。じゃあ、私からも……。\nありがとう、星梨花！", "zh": "嘿嘿。那么，我也要说一句……\n谢谢你，星梨花！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0056_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_06_1031_014mir", "source_sha256": "3d9ee6583ed66f0392b6a30d56d4f8d18f98cae2294c366f99cfe6eece7686ed", "ja": "私のこと、心配してくれてありがとう。\n足を怪我したのに、がんばってくれてありがとう！", "zh": "谢谢你为我担心。\n也谢谢你虽然脚受伤，依然为了大家这么努力！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0056_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_06_1032_014mir", "source_sha256": "e621e0acf7ccad1cd04d7fcf095f0088032965415daad60dfe44621658a46fbc", "ja": "星梨花が一緒に星空を見に来てくれて、\n私、すっごくすっごーく、うれしかったよ！", "zh": "星梨花能够跟我们一起来看这片星空，\n我真的、真的感到很开心喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0056_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_06_1033_022ser", "source_sha256": "ee0316189e0ac2c90804f5e1e8092a476a8ca9a0df9f9516c324386ffb292f6f", "ja": "未来さん……！", "zh": "未来姊姊……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0056_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_06_1034_041fuk", "source_sha256": "15011492b2f1904226f95d18c79e2135b96902eddf495e90842252ddb54b4e86", "ja": "……夜の山での流星群観測、本当に来てよかった\nですね、{$P$}さん。", "zh": "……有在晚上到山上来看流星雨，真是太好了，\n你说对吧，{$P$}先生。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0056_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_06_1035_017kth", "source_sha256": "f2abd771bb49f7a9b28713c89115fe5c037384675d338fd0a625733f7224faf9", "ja": "時には勇気を出して、\n冒険しないと手に入らない大切なもの……。", "zh": "有时候必须鼓起勇气去冒险，\n才能够得到重要的事物……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0056_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_06_1036_017kth", "source_sha256": "d4f342413d9f37d90a201f4cc6543555b8e4796580f3b05c240b90dbf1e3b661", "ja": "ふふっ、未来達は、\nしっかり見つけられたみたいです。", "zh": "呵呵，看来未来她们，\n已经顺利找到了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
